									"text" : "D4.mask.calculator calculates spatialization mask based on the incoming matrix\n\nOPTIONAL ARGUMENT: bus name (null or main out by default)\n\nINLETS:\n1 - Incoming jit.matrix.\n2 - Set the bus to monitor and whose mask should be altered.\n3 - Incoming med data.\n4 - Sending 1 calculates the mask, 0 and any other number are ignored.\n     IMPORTANT! This calculation takes place only after the next matrix is received.\n5 - Bang calculates and outputs the mask based on the current matrix.\n6 - Disable (1, by default not disabled or 0) sending mask to D4 and instead send it \n     manually elsewhere."
